[0.11,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[48;5;237m\u001b[38;5;231m- AC3. The\u001b[14Gmost overdue invoices come first; invoices overdue by the same number of \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdays are in the\u001b[20Grder of the\u001b[32Gr ids.\u001b[39m                                                 \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m- AC4. An invoice overdue by more than 90 days is left out: it has gone to the \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcollection agen\u001b[19Gy, and accounting\u001b[37Gcalls the agency themselves.\u001b[39m                 \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m- AC5. With nothing to\u001b[26Gremind, the outpu\u001b[44G is the head\u001b[57Gr lin\u001b[63G alone.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246mThought for \u001b[1m28s\u001b[22m, searched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m18\u001b[22m files, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI’ve\u001b[8Gread\u001b[13Gthe\u001b[17Gissue\u001b[23Gand\u001b[27Gthe\u001b[31Gproject’s\u001b[41Gloop\u001b[46Ginstructions.\u001b[60GBefore\u001b[67Gwriting\u001b[75Gany\u001b[79Gcode\u001b[84Gor\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gtests, here are th\u001b[23Gcases the acceptance cr\u001b[47Gteria leave op\u001b[62Gn. My \u001b[69Gecommended answe\u001b[87Gis\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bin parenth\u001b[14Gses,\u001b[19Gbut\u001b[23Ge\u001b[25Gch is your call.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mAC3 — how are ids compared for the tie-break?\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m  \u001b[6G- Plain string order (\u001b[38;5;153mINV-10\u001b[39m before \u001b[38;5;153mINV-2\u001b[39m), natural/numeric\u001b[66Gorder\u001b[72G(\u001b[38;5;153mINV-2\u001b[79G\u001b[39mbefore\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B \u001b[8G\u001b[38;5;153mINV-10\u001b[39m), or \u001b[38;5;153mlocaleCompare\u001b[39m (local\u001b[41G-dependent)?\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B-\u001b[8GWhat changes: the comparator and th\u001b[44G test fixture\u